          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of several luminous phenomena in the night sky: case classified as A for the 3rd PAN, very likely misidentification with the star Arcturus. The first two PAN are not identifiable or exploitable due to a lack of data.",
